# PrismStructure conventions

- Keep automation under `PrismStructure/` only.
- Prefer existing page objects / API helpers; do not invent new frameworks.
- Tag tests with `@smoke` or `@regression` in the title; stay within 5–8 cases per UI and API tier.
- Cash on Delivery invoice requires **Confirm twice**; single Confirm is a regression assertion.
- Invoice API payload must match the guide fixture (`billing_country: "TG"`).
- Do not commit secrets; use synthetic faker users only.
- Update `ai-prompts/` when debugging or redesigning — iterative evidence matters.
